Stage 3: dynamic stop + outcome labeler with 2.5R/3R/4R buckets

replay-engine/src/replay_engine/stage3/dynamic_stop.py
- Per spec section 6.2: stop is dynamic per setup
  - Long: more conservative of swing_low or deepest_cloud edge
  - Short: inverse (swing_high or deepest_cloud upper edge)
  - Floor 8pt, ceiling 18pt, default 12pt fallback
- Pivot detection: bar is pivot if low/high beats neighbors at 2 bars
  on each side, scanning last 20 bars
- StopLogic enum recorded for audit
- compute_dynamic_stop returns DynamicStop with raw_swing_distance
  and raw_cloud_distance for explainability

replay-engine/src/replay_engine/stage3/outcome_labeler.py
- Per spec section 6.3: walk-forward simulation with R-bucket tracking
- Walks bar-by-bar through OHLCV-1s data; high/low captures intra-bar
  wick action that hits stop or target (no full Trades schema needed)
- Tracks all three R-buckets in parallel (2.5R / 3R / 4R) plus
  max_r_achieved
- Primary outcome semantics:
  W  = r_to_2_5R hit (regardless of post-2.5R behavior)
  L  = stop hit before 2.5R
  BE = max_hold reached without resolution
  null = forward data exhausted before max_hold AND no resolution
- MFE/MAE in R-relative terms (peak/trough divided by dynamic stop)

tests/test_dynamic_stop.py - 14 tests
- Spec invariants (8/12/18 constants)
- Swing low/high pivot detection (clear pivot, no pivot, short data,
  most-recent-pivot priority)
- Cloud edge selection (long uses lower EMA, short uses upper)
- Long picks swing when more conservative; long picks cloud when
  more conservative
- Floor clamp at 8pt, ceiling clamp at 18pt
- Default 12pt fallback when no structural signal
- Short direction inverse
- Cloud on wrong side ignored (falls back to swing or default)

tests/test_outcome_labeler.py - 11 tests
- R bucket constants
- Stop hit returns L (with r_multiple = -1.0)
- 2.5R hit returns W; 3R runner; 4R full runner
- Time-stop returns BE when neither hit within 60s
- Short direction inverse (2.5R hit, stop hit)
- Empty forward data returns null outcome
- Insufficient forward data (ran out before max_hold) returns null
- MFE/MAE tracking
- Zero-stop validation raises
- Event-confounded flag passthrough

134 pytest pass total. Audit clean. 54 vitest still pass.

Stage 3 RUN remains halted until user confirms Databento OHLCV-1s
historical tier (Stage 1 prerequisite). Code is ready to consume
that data shape when entitlement confirmed.
